---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Hero from '../components/ui/Hero.astro';
import { responsive } from '../lib/responsive';
import { formatDate } from '../lib/format';
import { REGISTERED_NAME, ARN, TAGLINE, RISK_WARNING, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../lib/distributor';

// Set to the date the wording last changed, not the build date.
const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-10-20';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important disclaimers and legal information about Fund Investigator's analysis and data."
>
  <Hero size="sm">
    <h1 class:list={[responsive.display, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-6 leading-tight']}>
      Disclaimer
    </h1>
    <p class:list={[responsive.subtitle, 'text-fi-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed']}>
      Important information about the use of Fund Investigator
    </p>
  </Hero>

  <Section background="white" spacing="lg" maxWidth="md">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-slate mx-auto">

      {/* #65 / review must-have 4 (2026-10-20 draft, pending compliance review): "information
          only" is scoped to the public guides and tools, not the whole business; the
          distribution service is described in #distribution below. */}
      <h2 class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold">Our Public Content Is Not Advice</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        Fund Investigator's public guides, investigations and tools provide <strong>general information and analysis only</strong>. Nothing in them constitutes financial advice, an investment recommendation for you, or an offer to buy or sell securities. Separately, {REGISTERED_NAME} offers a mutual-fund distribution service, described under <a href="#distribution" class="text-fi-link underline decoration-fi-link/40 hover:decoration-fi-link">Distribution Relationship</a> below. For independent advice, consult a SEBI-registered Investment Adviser who understands your specific financial situation, goals, and risk tolerance.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold mt-8">No Investment Recommendations</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        Fund Investigator's tools and investigations do not recommend, endorse or promote any specific mutual fund, asset management company or investment strategy. They are data-driven and general. They do not consider your personal situation, goals or risk tolerance.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold mt-8">Data Accuracy and Timeliness</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        While we strive for accuracy, Fund Investigator makes <strong>no guarantees</strong> regarding the completeness, accuracy, or timeliness of the data presented. Data is sourced from publicly available sources including AMFI (Association of Mutual Funds in India) and fund house disclosures. Users should verify all information independently before making investment decisions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold mt-8">Past Performance Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Past performance is not indicative of future results.</strong> Historical returns, risk metrics, and portfolio characteristics may not reflect future fund performance. Market conditions, fund management, and investment strategies can change over time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold mt-8">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        Fund Investigator and its operators accept <strong>no liability</strong> for any losses, damages, or adverse outcomes resulting from reliance on the general information published on this website. Readers assume all risk associated with investment decisions they make on the basis of that information.
      </p>

      <h2 id="distribution" class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold mt-8">Distribution Relationship</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        Fund Investigator is run by {REGISTERED_NAME}, an {TAGLINE} ({ARN}). {REGISTERED_NAME}, {ARN}, distributes mutual-fund schemes in a Regular Plan capacity through the mutual funds with which we are empanelled. The complete affiliated-fund list and product-universe disclosure are provided to clients before an investment decision.
      </p>
      {/* COM-006 / COM-017 wording, 2026-10-19: the same text as the "Public research and your
          shortlist" note on /disclosures/. */}
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        Our public tools and investigation articles provide general educational information and do not consider any reader's personal circumstances. They are separate from a client-specific scheme shortlist. If you choose to use our mutual-fund distribution service, any shortlist is prepared separately after fact-finding, risk profiling and suitability assessment. Investments made through us are in regular plans and may earn us commission from the relevant AMC. <a href="/disclosures/" class="text-fi-link underline decoration-fi-link/40 hover:decoration-fi-link">See our disclosures</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold mt-8">Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        By using this website, you acknowledge that its public guides, investigations and tools are general information, and that you use them at your own risk. Clients of our distribution service receive a separate shortlist after fact-finding, risk profiling and suitability assessment. Whether you invest, and in what, is always your decision.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-heading-lg text-fi-ink font-bold mt-8">Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        This disclaimer may be updated from time to time. Continued use of Fund Investigator constitutes acceptance of any changes.
      </p>

      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-ink font-semibold leading-relaxed mt-8">{RISK_WARNING}</p>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-fi-light rounded-lg border-l-4 border-fi-gold">
        <p class="text-body-sm text-fi-muted font-semibold mb-2">Last updated: {formatDate(LAST_UPDATED)}</p>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-fi-muted">
          For questions about this disclaimer, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="text-fi-ink hover:text-fi-link underline">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
